,"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"文季","kind":"person","person_id":"408_ce3_5d8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0148","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_dk4_dds","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"曹虎","kind":"person","person_id":"jg8_wco_v2f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0202","start":202,"end":203,"surface":"稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_dk4_dds","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0211","start":211,"end":212,"surface":"稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_dk4_dds","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0268","start":268,"end":271,"surface":"陳顯達","kind":"person","person_id":"98c_dad_a4c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0406","start":406,"end":408,"surface":"江淹","kind":"person","person_id":"d13_e54_8ba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0411","start":411,"end":412,"surface":"稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_dk4_dds","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002:m0417","start":417,"end":419,"surface":"王瑩","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji","book_id":"b-liangshu-016","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-016-zhangji-ws1508503"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003","text":"及陳顯達起事，王侯復入宮。昭冑懲往時之懼，與弟永新侯昭穎逃奔江西，變形爲道人。崔慧景舉兵，昭冑兄弟出投之。慧景事敗，昭冑兄弟首出投臺軍主胡松，各以王侯還第。不自安，謀爲身計。子良故防閤桑偃爲梅蟲兒軍副，結前巴西太守蕭寅，謀立昭冑。昭冑許事克用寅爲尚書左僕射、護軍將軍。以寅有部曲，大事皆委之。時胡松領軍在新亭，寅遣人說之，云「須昏人出，寅等便率兵奉昭冑入臺，閉城號令。昏人必還就將軍，將軍但閉壘不應，則三公不足得也。」松又許諾。會東昏新起芳樂苑，月許日不復出遊，偃等議募健兒百餘人從萬春門入突取之，昭冑以爲不可。偃同黨王山沙慮事久無成，以事告御刀徐僧重。寅遣人殺山沙於路，吏於麝中得其事迹，昭冑兄弟與同黨皆伏誅。昭穎官至寧朔將軍、彭城太守。梁王定京邑，追贈昭冑散騎常侍、撫軍將軍，昭穎黃門郎。梁受禪，降封昭冑子周監利侯。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0001","surface":"陳顯達","start":1,"end":4,"person_id":"98c_dad_a4c","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0013","surface":"昭冑","start":13,"end":15,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0026","surface":"昭穎","start":26,"end":28,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0039","surface":"崔慧景","start":39,"end":42,"person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0045","surface":"昭冑","start":45,"end":47,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0053","surface":"慧景","start":53,"end":55,"person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0058","surface":"昭冑","start":58,"end":60,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0068","surface":"胡松","start":68,"end":70,"person_id":"qr4_4r6_24b","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0087","surface":"子良","start":87,"end":89,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0092","surface":"桑偃","start":92,"end":94,"person_id":"jle_qnt_6yr","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0095","surface":"梅蟲兒","start":95,"end":98,"person_id":"r8w_